  I want to understand the context this tool lives in. Is this something you'd project on a shared screen during your Teams call —
  everyone watching the same field while one person drives it? Or is it a tool each organizer opens individually and you compare notes?
  Because those are completely different interaction models — collaborative real-time vs. personal exploration — and the design would
  diverge significantly between them.

