  Here's the complete picture in one place:

  ---
  🫧  BATbern Topic Selector — Design Summary

  Concept: Physics-based blob visualization for intuitive topic selection. Three forces, one decision.

  The Three Forces:

  ┌────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │          Blob          │             Count             │                                Behavior                                │
  ├────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ 🔵 Blue — proposed     │ ~5-10, user-created           │ Summoned by typing → slides in from right edge                         │
  │ topics                 │                               │                                                                        │
  ├────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ 🟢 Green — partner     │ Up to 20 (9 partners × 1-2    │ Drift toward semantically similar blue blobs; logos visible always     │
  │ blobs                  │ topics)                       │                                                                        │
  ├────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ ⭐ Red stars — past    │ 57, dormant                   │ Ignite and repel if within 6-event window (~2 years); fade to          │
  │ events                 │                               │ background beyond that                                                 │
  ├────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ 👻 Ghosts — candidates │ Unlimited                     │ From backlog + partner votes + AI trends (fetched once). Click to      │
  │                        │                               │ awaken as blue.                                                        │
  └────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Similarity engine: AI categorization against BATbern's own 58-topic taxonomy clusters — trustworthy, domain-specific, not
  general-purpose.

  Override mechanic: Drag any blob manually to merge or force proximity. Red blob held close = acknowledged warning. Stays as orbiting
  satellite.

  Decision: Double-click accepted blue blob → session note auto-generated (topic, partner alignment, last covered N events ago, competing
   candidates).

  Canvas: Infinite, zoomable. Dark navy void. "Fit all" zoom-out button.

  Session mode: Single driver, shared screen, Teams call.

  Data sources: All already in BATbern except organizer backlog list (small addition to partner coordination page) + one AI
  trending-topics call at session start.

